    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσᾴδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sing to,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὶν ποταείσομαι</span>
			<i>to</i> thee <i>will I sing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τραγῳδίᾳ</span>
			<i>sing the songs in</i> a tragedy, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				401
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristaenet.
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῇ κιθάρᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					14.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαείσαντος αὐτοῦ τοῦ
			θεοῦ</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).528
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Lycosura</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>harmonize, chime in with,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i>with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				405
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				86e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				670b
			</span></i>.</div>
